{"seq":2,"slug":"estimation-techniques","title":"估算技术体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/foundations/estimation-techniques","wordCount":1927,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"估算技术体系\">估算技术体系</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>估算技术的选择应匹配项目阶段的信息可用性和决策精度需求。从类比估算到自下而上估算，精度从 ±50% 收敛到 ±10%，但所需信息和时间成本也在递增。最有效的策略是多方法交叉验证——当两种方法的差异超过 2 倍时，信号是&quot;你对项目的理解有盲区&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"技术选择的决策框架\">技术选择的决策框架</h2><p>估算技术不是越精确越好——精确度伴随着成本。在项目早期花三天做自下而上估算是浪费，因为此时需求不确定性远大于估算方法的精度差异。正确的做法是根据项目阶段、可用信息和决策需求选择&quot;刚好足够&quot;的方法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A{项目阶段?} --&gt;|概念/预算| B[类比估算]&#10;    A --&gt;|需求已明确| C{有历史数据?}&#10;    A --&gt;|详细设计完成| D[自下而上估算]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[参数估算]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| F[三点估算 PERT]&#10;    B --&gt; G[精度 ±50%]&#10;    E --&gt; H[精度 ±25-30%]&#10;    F --&gt; I[精度 ±15-25%]&#10;    D --&gt; J[精度 ±10-15%]&#10;    G --&gt; K{决策是否足够?}&#10;    H --&gt; K&#10;    I --&gt; K&#10;    J --&gt; K&#10;    K --&gt;|是| L[执行]&#10;    K --&gt;|否| M[增加信息/换方法]\">flowchart TD\n    A{项目阶段?} --&gt;|概念/预算| B[类比估算]\n    A --&gt;|需求已明确| C{有历史数据?}\n    A --&gt;|详细设计完成| D[自下而上估算]\n    C --&gt;|是| E[参数估算]\n    C --&gt;|否| F[三点估算 PERT]\n    B --&gt; G[精度 ±50%]\n    E --&gt; H[精度 ±25-30%]\n    F --&gt; I[精度 ±15-25%]\n    D --&gt; J[精度 ±10-15%]\n    G --&gt; K{决策是否足够?}\n    H --&gt; K\n    I --&gt; K\n    J --&gt; K\n    K --&gt;|是| L[执行]\n    K --&gt;|否| M[增加信息/换方法]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>输入要求</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>耗时</th>\n<th>最佳场景</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类比估算</td>\n<td>1-3 个类似项目</td>\n<td>±50%</td>\n<td>0.5-2h</td>\n<td>销售提案、预算估计</td>\n<td>类比对象选择偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T-shirt Sizing</td>\n<td>团队直觉</td>\n<td>定性排序</td>\n<td>15-30min</td>\n<td>路线图排序</td>\n<td>无法转换为日历时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数估算</td>\n<td>规模指标+模型参数</td>\n<td>±25%</td>\n<td>2-8h</td>\n<td>可复制类型项目</td>\n<td>模型校准失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三点估算</td>\n<td>专家判断×3</td>\n<td>±15%</td>\n<td>1-3h/任务</td>\n<td>高不确定性任务</td>\n<td>悲观值不够悲观</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自下而上</td>\n<td>完整 WBS</td>\n<td>±10%</td>\n<td>1-3 天</td>\n<td>固定范围合同</td>\n<td>遗漏工作项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故事点</td>\n<td>参考故事+团队共识</td>\n<td>相对排序</td>\n<td>15min/故事</td>\n<td>Sprint 规划</td>\n<td>校准漂移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"类比估算-analogous-estimation\">类比估算（Analogous Estimation）</h2><p>类比估算的逻辑是&quot;这个项目和之前的 X 项目结构类似，X 花了 3 个月，这个应该也差不多&quot;。它是最古老、最直觉化的方法，也是唯一在项目极早期（只有一句话描述）就能使用的方法。</p>\n<p>操作步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>识别 1-3 个结构相似的历史项目</li>\n<li>记录这些项目的实际工作量（非估算值）</li>\n<li>分析差异因素并赋权：更多平台（+30%）、更简单工作流（-20%）、新技术栈（+15%）</li>\n<li>产出范围估算并明确标注调整因子</li>\n</ol>\n<p>类比估算的质量完全取决于两个因素：参考项目与当前项目的<strong>结构相似度</strong>，以及你使用的是<strong>实际数据</strong>还是原始估算。Fora Soft 在 625 个已交付项目的基础上建立了类比库，其估算准确率（15% 偏差内）达到 78%。</p>\n<p>关键陷阱：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>选择性记忆：倾向于记住顺利的项目，忽略灾难性的项目</li>\n<li>表面相似 vs 结构相似：技术栈相同不等于复杂度相同</li>\n<li>忽略上下文差异：同一个功能在遗留代码库和绿地项目中工作量可能差 5 倍</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"参数估算-parametric-estimation\">参数估算（Parametric Estimation）</h2><p>参数估算通过数学模型将规模指标转换为工作量。最经典的模型是 COCOMO II（Constructive Cost Model）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>b</mi></msup><mo>×</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = a \\times (KLOC)^b \\times \\prod_{i=1}^{n} EM_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是工作量（人月），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">KLOC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是千行代码数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是模型常数（取决于项目类型），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EM_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是成本驱动因子（如团队经验、平台复杂度、需求稳定性等）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目类型</th>\n<th>a</th>\n<th>b</th>\n<th>典型特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有机型（Organic）</td>\n<td>2.4</td>\n<td>1.05</td>\n<td>小团队、熟悉领域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半分离型（Semi-detached）</td>\n<td>3.0</td>\n<td>1.12</td>\n<td>中等规模、混合经验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入式（Embedded）</td>\n<td>3.6</td>\n<td>1.20</td>\n<td>强约束、高可靠性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>功能点分析（FPA）是另一种参数方法，通过计算系统的功能元素（外部输入、外部输出、外部接口、内部逻辑文件、外部查询）来度量规模，避免了代码行数对语言和编码风格的依赖。</p>\n<p>参数估算的核心优势是<strong>可校准</strong>——模型参数可以根据组织历史数据调整。但它的致命弱点在于：模型是在特定历史条件下拟合的，当技术范式发生根本性变化时（如从瀑布到敏捷、从单体到微服务），历史参数可能完全失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三点估算与-pert\">三点估算与 PERT</h2><p>三点估算通过三个值显式捕捉不确定性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{PERT} = \\frac{O + 4M + P}{6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma = \\frac{P - O}{6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span> = 乐观估计（一切顺利时），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> = 最可能估计（最大概率结果），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> = 悲观估计（主要风险都发生时）。</p>\n<p>三点估算的实际价值不仅是产生一个加权平均值，更重要的是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>它<strong>强制</strong>估算者思考极端场景</li>\n<li>标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 量化了不确定性程度</li>\n<li>可以通过中心极限定理在任务层面聚合为项目层面的分布</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 单任务估算&#10;    A[乐观 O=3天] --&gt; D[期望 E=5天]&#10;    B[最可能 M=5天] --&gt; D&#10;    C[悲观 P=12天] --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E[σ=1.5天]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 项目聚合&#10;    E --&gt; F[项目σ = √Σσi²]&#10;    F --&gt; G[项目置信区间]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 单任务估算\n    A[乐观 O=3天] --&gt; D[期望 E=5天]\n    B[最可能 M=5天] --&gt; D\n    C[悲观 P=12天] --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E[σ=1.5天]\n    end\n    subgraph 项目聚合\n    E --&gt; F[项目σ = √Σσi²]\n    F --&gt; G[项目置信区间]\n    end</pre><p>实践中最常见的错误是<strong>悲观值不够悲观</strong>。当被问&quot;最坏情况&quot;时，人们给出的通常是&quot;比较差的情况&quot;而非真正的最坏情况。解决方案：要求估算者具体描述悲观场景下发生了哪些事件（如&quot;发现需要重写认证模块 + 外部 API 变更 + 关键开发者请假两周&quot;），而不是仅仅给一个数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自下而上估算-bottom-up\">自下而上估算（Bottom-Up）</h2><p>自下而上估算将 WBS（工作分解结构）的每个叶子节点逐一估算后向上汇总。它是精度最高的方法，但也是成本最高的——一个 200K 美元的项目通常需要 1-3 天来完成自下而上估算。</p>\n<p>操作流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>将项目分解为 WBS 叶子节点（每个不超过 2-5 人天）</li>\n<li>对每个叶子节点进行估算（可用三点估算）</li>\n<li>加入间接开销：项目管理（+12%）、QA（+25%）、代码评审（+8%）</li>\n<li>加入风险储备（已知风险 15%、新技术 30%、R&amp;D 50%+）</li>\n<li>根据团队速率转换为日历时间</li>\n</ol>\n<p>自下而上估算的最大风险不是单个节点估算不准，而是<strong>遗漏</strong>。研究表明即使经验丰富的团队在 WBS 分解中也会遗漏 10-20% 的工作项。常见遗漏包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>环境搭建与配置</li>\n<li>数据迁移与清洗</li>\n<li>跨系统集成测试</li>\n<li>文档与知识转移</li>\n<li>部署与发布准备</li>\n<li>会议、沟通和协调开销</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{total} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} E_i \\times (1 + overhead) \\times (1 + risk\\_reserve) \\times \\frac{1}{utilization}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">eser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">utilization</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是有效利用率（通常 0.6-0.75，反映会议、邮件等非项目活动）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"估算方法的组合使用\">估算方法的组合使用</h2><p>实践中最有效的策略不是选择单一方法，而是多方法交叉验证：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>启动阶段</strong>：类比估算设定数量级 + 参考类预测建立基准</li>\n<li><strong>规划阶段</strong>：参数模型给出整体范围 + 三点估算处理高不确定性模块</li>\n<li><strong>执行阶段</strong>：故事点驱动 Sprint 规划 + 蒙特卡洛模拟发布日期</li>\n</ol>\n<p>如果两种方法给出的结果差异超过 2 倍，这本身就是重要信号——它意味着你对项目的理解存在重大盲区，需要先投入时间消除信息不对称，而非匆忙选择其中一个数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>估算技术不是越精确越好，而是越匹配越好。项目早期用类比估算快速建立数量级感知，需求明确后用参数模型或三点估算量化不确定性，详细设计完成后用自下而上估算精确规划。多方法交叉验证能有效暴露理解盲区，当结果差异超过 2 倍时应先投入时间消除信息不对称。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"estimation-principles\">估算原则</a> 讨论了选择方法前必须建立的认知框架；<a href=\"uncertainty-modeling\">不确定性建模</a> 将三点估算扩展为更完整的概率分布模型。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"估算技术体系","id":"估算技术体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"技术选择的决策框架","id":"技术选择的决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"类比估算（Analogous Estimation）","id":"类比估算-analogous-estimation"},{"level":2,"text":"参数估算（Parametric Estimation）","id":"参数估算-parametric-estimation"},{"level":2,"text":"三点估算与 PERT","id":"三点估算与-pert"},{"level":2,"text":"自下而上估算（Bottom-Up）","id":"自下而上估算-bottom-up"},{"level":2,"text":"估算方法的组合使用","id":"估算方法的组合使用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"估算原则与认知偏差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/foundations/estimation-principles"},"next":{"title":"不确定性建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/software-estimation-planning/foundations/uncertainty-modeling"}}